     PERFORM SAVE-RENDER
     MOVE 15 TO WS-A
     MOVE "minecraft:beacon" TO WS-KEY
     MOVE 16 TO WS-SVL
     MOVE 5 TO WS-X
     MOVE 70 TO WS-Y
